69
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:19,940
Careful. You say that without any hard evidence. It's only idle gossip.

70
00:07:20,380 --> 00:07:23,540
Whatever it is, the dignity of all the knights is in the balance.

71
00:07:24,100 --> 00:07:27,180
We cannot allow this Kerr to go on doing as he pleases.

72
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,660
Count Mazurak.

73
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:37,300
I understand that you go out of your way to avoid destructive acts of aggression because your priority is focused on seizing Earth's resources.

74
00:07:38,300 --> 00:07:45,980
And no, I do not criticize you for these actions. However, now is the time to press on with the invasion of Earth immediately.

75
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:51,580
If this continues, the noble authority of the 37 clans will only decline further.

76
00:07:52,100 --> 00:07:56,640
We need an alliance that will set aside differences and work together for the common good.

77
00:07:57,180 --> 00:07:59,460
What are your thoughts on this, Count Mazurak?

78
00:07:59,460 --> 00:08:11,400
It is a poor knight that slays any who would show him defiance.

79
00:08:11,660 --> 00:08:15,100
