83
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:25,640
Which is exactly why I need to make sure they remember them.

84
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:32,000
Basically, you're pretty healthy. I don't see anything particularly concerning now.

85
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:36,660
