92
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:59,380
Ah, so they're restraining themselves by choice.

93
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:01,340
Here's an idea.

94
00:09:01,700 --> 00:09:01,940
Hmm?

95
00:09:01,940 --> 00:09:10,320
How about this? What if their attacks have diminished because they never imagined their greatest cataphracts would be taken out one after the other like dominoes?

96
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:14,760
Things haven't exactly gone according to plan for them. Maybe they're feeling a little threatened.

97
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:21,740
