101
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:34,260
Yeah. She wanted him out of the military, so she kept going to the top brass.

102
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:36,780
I thought that was just a story from the rumor mill.

103
00:09:37,780 --> 00:09:41,600
You know, that they finally got upset with her pestering, so they stationed her here.

104
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:47,840
Possible enemy sky carrier detected in the south.

105
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,180
Run! Get the station!

106
